    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How much do packers and movers charge in Chennai for transporting a car to Mumbai?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Charges vary based on vehicle size, distance, insurance level, and any additional services. Typically, a compact car costs between INR 8,000‑10,000, while larger SUVs may range from INR 12,000‑15,000. Our transparent quote engine breaks down each component so you know exactly what you pay.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What is the estimated transit time for a car shipment from Chennai to Mumbai?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Using the NH 16 corridor, the average door‑to‑door transit time is 28‑32 hours, depending on traffic and weather conditions. Real‑time GPS tracking lets you monitor progress, and scheduled pit stops ensure drivers comply with safety regulations without delaying delivery.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is there a zero‑scratch guarantee for my vehicle during the move?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Our zero‑scratch guarantee includes a joint inspection, hydraulic ramp loading, 4‑wheel lock, and edge padding. Any damage incurred during transit is fully covered by our 100 % IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance, giving you peace of mind throughout the journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What RTO documents are required for an inter‑state car transfer from Chennai to Mumbai?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You’ll need the original registration certificate, insurance copy, a valid pollution under control (PUC) certificate, a signed transport agreement, and a government‑issued e‑Way bill. Our compliance team assists you in preparing and submitting all paperwork to avoid delays.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my vehicle live while it’s on the road?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. Every enclosed carrier is equipped with satellite GPS that provides live location updates via our client portal. You receive real‑time alerts at key milestones, ensuring complete visibility from Chennai departure to Mumbai delivery.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Do you provide insurance for high‑value or classic cars?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. We offer IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance covering 100 % declared value, ideal for classic, luxury, or high‑value vehicles. Optional extended coverage can be added for extra peace of mind, and our team handles all claim procedures if needed.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What makes your enclosed carrier different from open‑deck transport?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our specialized enclosed carriers feature hydraulic ramps, multi‑car trailers, and climate‑controlled interiors, protecting your vehicle from dust, weather, and road debris. Combined with 4‑wheel lock systems and edge padding, this ensures a scratch‑free, secure transit compared to open‑deck options.</p>
      </div>
